# PolyBuzz

> PolyBuzz is a public AI character and conversation platform focused on roleplay chat, topical AI experiences, image generation, and fandom-oriented discovery. This file points to Markdown reference documents derived from the live public site and the current frontend implementation.

All links below point to Markdown files hosted on the PolyBuzz site. These documents are intended to help language models understand the platform's public entry points, topic hubs, collection pages, and trust or policy references without starting from individual character detail pages.

## Documentation

- [Platform Overview](https://www.polybuzz.ai/llms/overview.md): High-level summary of PolyBuzz's public web surface, navigation patterns, and primary product categories.
- [Core Entry Points](https://www.polybuzz.ai/llms/core-entry-points.md): Summary of the homepage, Discover, AI Image Generator, and Creation Guide based on live pages and current implementation.
- [Topic and Directory Hubs](https://www.polybuzz.ai/llms/topic-and-directory-hubs.md): Summary of the public topic index, tags directory, AI Girlfriend, Ask AI, and Virtual Assistant pages.
- [Series and Collection Pages](https://www.polybuzz.ai/llms/series-and-collection-pages.md): Summary of collection-style pages such as Anime, Manga, Movie, music-group, festival, and zodiac hubs.
- [Help and Policy References](https://www.polybuzz.ai/llms/help-and-policy.md): Summary of FAQ, privacy, terms, and content-guideline pages.

